- NPM: `react-animated-cursor` and `react-cursor-follow`. citeturn0search17turn0search7  
- GitHub: `react-mouse-follower` (Framer Motion). citeturn0search5  
- Demos: CodePen / CodeSandbox “eyes follow mouse” examples. citeturn0search1turn0search0  
